0..77 Comment "/// A loop inside another loop\'s body carries no slot through its passes: the"
78..155 Comment "/// outer body\'s ends continue what follows the outer loop, so the inner loop"
156..220 Comment "/// reads the slot it names inside a fixpoint. The loops may run"
221..262 Comment "/// forever, so the row states `Partial`."
